  "implemented": [
    "One genuine restricted-session operations.job.interrupt command atomically cancels or confirms a replacement after actual Mobile departure, with fresh mutation/read authority and epoch/hash/version bindings",
    "Actual stop, reason, observed trip/appointment/current scope and explicit cancellation communication or replacement customer confirmation are mandatory; no fake arrival or unsupported intermediate work state",
    "Stopped travel is an appended cancelled leg with the actual destination, retained planned origin/destination/departure/rig and one server instant shared by job/event; mileage remains independent",
    "Replacement uses the existing time/location/contact/confirmation grammar, fresh customer/operator/vehicle/mode checks, actual schedule conflicts/unknown-travel acknowledgment and explicit override records",
    "Cancellation retains every explicit scope identity/gross/discount/final value and another completed visit, without changing accepted obligations or creating a fee/refund/posting",
    "Existing scheduled actions remain intact; exact fixed statement/row/audit/plan/reservation/field/amendment guard branches delegate only the new kind to its own source/result closure",
    "Original receipts reconstruct immutable sources/audits after later departure/arrival, accepted amendments and completion; replay never retries the physical action",
    "Native compound tests cover previously amended authorization, another completed visit, later amendment originals and cancellation despite a subsequently archived customer",
    "Invalid/foreign/stale inputs, started labor, unknown finance schema, two real competing devices, forged actual-stop data and late COMMIT failure refuse with rollback",
    "Shared real amendment fixture reuses the existing command bodies unchanged; all retained field/completion/mileage paths execute alongside interruption"
  ],
